.TH NEO-CALENDAR-REMINDERS 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-calendar-reminders \- reminder service of the GNOME Phone calendar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-calendar-reminders
.SH DESCRIPTION
Notifies at each event reminder with the calendar app closed, and asks neo-wakeup to wake the phone for it. It runs as the systemd user service neo-calendar-reminders.service and owns de.yesman.Calendar.Reminders on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-calendar(1), neo-wakeup(8)
